Note, Simple REST API example.

Create a dictionary called greeting.
Set the entry message in greeting to Hello from E++.
Set the entry version in greeting to 1.

Define handle home that takes request,
    Respond with Welcome to the E++ API.
End define.

Define handle api that takes request,
    Respond with the value of greeting.
End define.

Start a webserver on port 8080.
Add route GET slash to handle home.
Add route GET slash api to handle api.

Say Server ready. Visit localhost 8080.
Wait for connections.
